  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot or deep skillet with a lid over medium-high heat. Add the chicken, salt, pepper, and thyme. Cook 4 minutes, stirring, until lightly browned on the outside.",
    "Add the onion and carrots. Cook 3 minutes, until the onion softens.",
    "Stir in the garlic and rice. Cook 1 minute, stirring, so the rice is coated.",
    "Pour in the water and scrape up any browned bits from the bottom. Bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cover. Cook 15 minutes, without lifting the lid, until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed.",
    "Scatter the peas over the rice, cover, and let stand off the heat for 5 minutes.",
    "Check that the chicken reads 165 F in the thickest piece. Fluff with a fork and serve."
  ],
